          "short": "$x^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{x^4}&=\\sqrt{(x^2)^2}\\\\&=|x^2|\\\\&=x^2\\end{align*}$$\nSince $x^2\\geq0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
